    "threads": [
      {
        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on subscription value proposition, tiers and pricing approach.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, kicking off the 'Launch of New Subscription-Based Product Line' project. I've created the initial 'Subscription Product Brief and Value Proposition' (A1) which covers our work for T1. Please review the target segments and proposed tiers. Let's get aligned on this foundation first. CC @242297 @59927 @270220 @514149",
            "mentions": [
              242297,
              59927,
              270220,
              514149
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks for getting this started. The value prop in A1 is clear, but how does it stack up against our main competitors? I want to ensure we're not just another 'me-too' offer. The differentiation needs to be crystal clear.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 514149,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "The segments defined in A1 look right to me. They align well with our existing customer base and the market research we did last quarter.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_check_mark",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Good point. Our key differentiator is the 'quality control' aspect, which is a known pain point with competitor products. I've emphasized that in the messaging section of A1.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 59927,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "In A1, does the Premium Tier include priority support? I think that would be a good benefit.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 270220,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "The value prop feels strong enough to move forward. We can always refine messaging later. I think we should approve it and start working on the pricing.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "@59927 Yes, it's listed under the 'Premium Tier Benefits' section in A1. Let me know if it's not clear.",
            "mentions": [
              59927
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Okay, highlighting the quality control angle works. I'm comfortable approving the target segments and value prop as they are. Let's formalize that.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "Great. Decision D1 is confirmed. Now for pricing (T2). I've put some initial price bands in A1 for discussion. What are your thoughts?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 270220,
            "reply_to": "M9",
            "text": "The bands look reasonable. We can probably just do a simple cost-plus model to finalize the numbers for T2. It's quick and straightforward.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M11",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "I'd advise against a simple cost-plus model. For a subscription product, value-based pricing is more sustainable and better reflects the ongoing benefit to the customer. It protects our margins and aligns price with the value prop we just approved.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M12",
            "speaker_id": 59927,
            "reply_to": "M11",
            "text": "How do we calculate value-based pricing? Is there a template for that?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M13",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M11",
            "text": "I agree with @242297. Value-based is the right approach. @59927, it's about quantifying the value our service provides and pricing based on that. For T2, let's start by modeling two options: a 'Standard' tier at $19/mo and a 'Premium' at $49/mo, focusing on the distinct value of each.",
            "mentions": [
              242297,
              59927
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M14",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M13",
            "text": "That's a good starting point. Let's select those two tiers and price points for the initial detailed modeling. We can add a third tier later if needed.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D2"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M15",
            "speaker_id": 514149,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "Sounds good. I can take the lead on building out the financial model for those two tiers.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M16",
            "speaker_id": 270220,
            "reply_to": "M11",
            "text": "Ok, value-based makes sense. Happy to move forward with that approach.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M17",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "Perfect. Decision D2 is locked. @514149, please take on the detailed modeling for T2. Let's aim to have a draft ready for review by EOD tomorrow.",
            "mentions": [
              514149
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D2"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M18",
            "speaker_id": 59927,
            "reply_to": "M17",
            "text": "Ok, I understand now. Thanks for the clarification.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          }
        ],
        "thread_outcome": {
