      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Define KPI framework, dashboard spec and reporting cadence.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, let's finalize our measurement plan. I've drafted the 'KPI Definitions and Dashboard Spec' (A6) to cover T6. It includes proposed KPIs like sign-ups, churn, and ARPU. Please review and provide feedback. @242297 @514149 @270220 @59927",
            "mentions": [
              242297,
              514149,
              270220,
              59927
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6",
              "T6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Thanks. The list in A6 is good, but it's focused on volume metrics. To ensure we're building a profitable business, we must track the LTV:CAC ratio as a core health metric. Can we add that?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 270220,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Sorry, what is CAC? Just want to be sure.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "@270220 It's Customer Acquisition Cost. The formula and data source are defined in A6.",
            "mentions": [
              270220
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 59927,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Should we also add page views for the new subscription landing page to the main dashboard?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M50",
            "text": "Page views are more of a diagnostic metric for the marketing team. Let's keep the main KPI dashboard focused on core business outcomes like revenue and customer growth. The LTV:CAC ratio is essential for that. @320085, please add it.",
            "mentions": [
              320085
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Absolutely. I've added LTV:CAC to the core KPI list in A6. With that change, are we ready to confirm this list of KPIs?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "Yes, the list is confirmed.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "Great. Now for reporting cadence. I propose I share a daily KPI update in this channel for the first week post-launch, then switch to a weekly summary. How does that sound?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M55",
            "speaker_id": 514149,
            "reply_to": "M54",
            "text": "That works for me. I can take on the task of setting up and validating the dashboard (T9) based on the final spec in A6.",
            "mentions": [],
